(STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE: INVOICE PAYMENT & AUDIT WORKFLOW) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Purpose and Scope) Tj
T* (This procedure outlines the end-to-end verification and disbursement process for vendor invoices.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Process Steps) Tj
T* (Step 1: Accounts Payable receives the vendor invoice by email and enters the invoice into SAP.) Tj
T* (Step 2: Accounts Payable performs 3-way matching against the Purchase Order and Goods Receipt.) Tj
T* (Step 3: If invoice amount exceeds 0,000, Finance Director conducts executive budget review.) Tj
T* (Step 4: If budget review is rejected, Accounts Payable sends a dispute notification to the vendor.) Tj
T* (Step 5: If approved or under threshold, Treasury schedules the automated bank wire transfer.) Tj
T* (Step 6: Finance Specialist archives the payment confirmation receipt and closes the account record.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Responsible Actors) Tj
T* (Accounts Payable, Finance Director, Treasury, and Finance Specialist.) Tj
